<text top="1226" left="129" width="88" height="21" font="1"><i>Dear Santa,</i></text>
<text top="1226" left="129" width="324" height="21" font="1"><i>I love Christmas and I love you. This year </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="129" width="325" height="21" font="1"><i>I want you to bring me a new computer </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="129" width="322" height="21" font="1"><i>because the old one is broken and a pair of </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="129" width="157" height="21" font="1"><i>pink sneakers,  please.</i></text>
<text top="1226" left="329" width="50" height="21" font="1"><i>Thanks</i></text>
<text top="1226" left="329" width="66" height="21" font="1"><i>Christina</i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="88" height="21" font="1"><i>Dear Santa,</i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="327" height="21" font="1"><i>I’m looking forward to your visit. I’ll have your </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="328" height="21" font="1"><i>favourite cookies and a glass of milk by the </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="327" height="21" font="1"><i>fireplace ready for you. Please bring me a big </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="327" height="21" font="1"><i>red truck. And a new bike for my friend Annie </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="328" height="21" font="1"><i>who lives next door but her parents cannot </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="213" height="21" font="1"><i>afford to get one for her.   </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="746" width="6" height="21" font="1"><i> </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="485" width="6" height="21" font="1"><i>  </i></text>
