<text top="1236" left="117" width="369" height="22" font="18"><i>Read the postcards and fill in the missing sentences:</i></text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="437" height="21" font="6">a) I love feijoada (a stew of beans) and cabobs (grilled meat).</text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="414" height="21" font="6">b) but this year we are in Finland enjoying Santa’s village. </text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="224" height="21" font="6">c) I’m having a wonderful time.</text>
<text top="1236" left="117" width="201" height="21" font="6">d) it’s a house made of logs.</text>
