<text top="1241" left="104" width="50" height="15" font="23"><i>Hi, Molly!</i></text>
<text top="1241" left="105" width="252" height="15" font="23"><i>I’m sending you this postcard from Finland.</i></text>
<text top="1241" left="107" width="262" height="15" font="23"><i>We usually spend Christmas at my father’s </i></text>
<text top="1241" left="108" width="271" height="15" font="23"><i>home town, ...................................................................................</i></text>
<text top="1241" left="109" width="276" height="15" font="23"><i>............................. Oh, it’s great! Everything is white </i></text>
<text top="1241" left="111" width="278" height="15" font="23"><i>with snow and there are beautiful decorations </i></text>
<text top="1241" left="112" width="251" height="15" font="23"><i>everywhere. We are staying in a log cabin  </i></text>
<text top="1241" left="113" width="257" height="15" font="23"><i>...........................................................................................................</i></text>
<text top="1241" left="114" width="259" height="15" font="23"><i>....................................................- and there is a lovely </i></text>
<text top="1241" left="116" width="173" height="15" font="23"><i>Christmas tree in the garden.</i></text>
<text top="1241" left="241" width="117" height="15" font="23"><i>Have a nice holiday </i></text>
<text top="1241" left="242" width="37" height="15" font="23"><i>Sandy</i></text>
<text top="1236" left="411" width="257" height="15" font="24"><i>HI! I’m on a holiday in Brazil. The weather is </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="410" width="272" height="15" font="24"><i>hot and the food is great. ..............................................</i></text>
<text top="1236" left="409" width="274" height="15" font="24"><i>..................................................................................................................</i></text>
<text top="1236" left="408" width="186" height="15" font="24"><i>The people are very hospitable. </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="407" width="261" height="15" font="24"><i>It’s amazing: they can dance all day. At the</i></text>
<text top="1236" left="406" width="243" height="15" font="24"><i> moment,  we are visiting Rio de Janeiro. </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="405" width="274" height="15" font="24"><i>..................................................................................................................</i></text>
<text top="1236" left="404" width="224" height="15" font="24"><i>You must visit this country one day! </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="403" width="31" height="15" font="24"><i>Love </i></text>
<text top="1236" left="402" width="45" height="15" font="24"><i>Dimitris</i></text>
