<text top="1226" left="657" width="151" height="21" font="1"><i>         ……………………..  </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="664" height="21" font="1"><i>for her other dolls as she can never have enough. My mum needs a new bag and </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="256" height="21" font="1"><i>a dish washer.                     </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="667" height="21" font="1"><i>For my Dad you can bring a new car but I don’t know if you can carry it on </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="667" height="21" font="1"><i>your sledge. I know it is big and heavy. Maybe you can send it through the </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="210" height="21" font="1"><i>post - is that possible? </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="664" height="21" font="1"><i>Oh, you mustn’t forget my          …………………….. I think she needs some new teeth </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="668" height="21" font="1"><i>because she cannot eat hard things and I feel sorry for her. My granddad </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="666" height="21" font="1"><i>would like a new rocking chair because the old one is creaking and a new pair </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="256" height="21" font="1"><i>of                ……………….         </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="71" height="21" font="1"><i>           </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="665" height="21" font="1"><i>Please bring my          ………………… Indefix some            ……………... He just loves </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="665" height="21" font="1"><i>them. And for my friend Penny a beautiful pink        ………………. She says she has </i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="298" height="21" font="1"><i>nothing to wear on Christmas Day.</i></text>
<text top="1226" left="138" width="500" height="21" font="1"><i>I hope you have enough space on your sledge for all these </i></text>
